1
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,080
(Leonard:)All I'm saying is, if they
took all the money they spent

2
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,640
(Leonard:)trying to make
a decent Hulk movie,

3
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:13,110
(Leonard:)they could probably
just make an actual Hulk.

4
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,070
(Sheldon:)That is apt and amusing.

5
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,240
(Sheldon:)I think I shall share that

6
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,940
(Sheldon:)with Amy Farrah Fowler.

7
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,360
(Sheldon:)She'll appreciate
the witticism.

8
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,740
(Leonard:)Thank you.

9
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,140
(Sheldon:)It'll also help improve her
initial impression of you.

10
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,810
(Leonard:)So what's going on with you two?

11
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:31,750
(Sheldon:)Well, the status is
as it always was.

12
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:33,650
(Sheldon:)She's a girl. She's a friend.

13
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:34,750
(Sheldon:)She is not my--

14
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:36,040
(Sheldon:)please forgive me
for doing this--

15
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,660
"girlfriend."

16
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,510
(Leonard:)Right, right.

17
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:42,510
(Leonard:)So you're still just
texting and emailing?

18
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:45,010
(Leonard:)You don't feel any need
to hang out with her, you know--

19
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:46,880
(Leonard:)be in the same room?

20
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,720
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you are
my best friend.

21
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:51,120
(Sheldon:)I've known you
for seven years,

22
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:54,060
(Sheldon:)and I can barely tolerate
sitting on the couch with you.

23
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:58,190
(Sheldon:)Imagine my attitude regarding
prolonged physical proximity

24
00:00:58,190 --> 00:00:59,680
(Sheldon:)to Amy Farrah Fowler.

25
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:01,360
(Leonard:)Got it.

